{"id":"wb-7-1256","name":"北五省会馆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北五省会馆","text":"北五省会馆，又名湘潭关圣殿，位于中华人民共和国湖南省湘潭市雨湖区。建于清康熙初年（1665年前后），为北五省（山东、山西、陕西、河南、甘肃）旅谭商民祭祀关羽所建，是当时湘潭的作为商业重镇的代表之一。2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%94%E7%9C%81%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86","revisionId":94228116,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94228116","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c8405bd0221a0bbbca8d6611.jpg","title":"North_Five_Provinces_Huiguan234.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:North_Five_Provinces_Huiguan234.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/North_Five_Provinces_Huiguan234.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FreeePedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"North Five Provinces Huiguan","width":320,"height":136}}